= The Longest Shutdown

The federal government has shut down in a fight over spending and health-care subsidies. Federal workers go unpaid, air travel is disrupted, and food benefits are in doubt.

- @shutdown_hold_firm: Hold firm on healthcare
- @shutdown_cave: Reopen the government

@shutdown_hold_firm
on-arrival: shutdown_done = 1; healthcare_agenda += 1; dem_enthusiasm += 0.8; progressive_dissent -= 4; moderate_dissent += 3; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent)

We refuse to cave. The standoff drags on for weeks.

@shutdown_cave
on-arrival: shutdown_done = 1; progressive_dissent += 7; dem_enthusiasm -= 0.8; moderate_strength += 1

We reopen the government with promises of a vote later. Our base is furious.
